      "text": "FUTURE / OPTIONAL - not required for MVP\nCorporate CSR integration | Individual donors | Government agencies | International NGOs\nVolunteer matching | Logistics companies | Warehouses | Payment / donation processing\nPredictive resource demand | Disaster-response coordination | Cross-city resource routing\nAutomated procurement | Public transparency dashboards",
